"松井 章","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:205584","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"とらら","creatorId":"vndb:s22109","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s22109","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s22109","name":"とらら","roleCode":"director","roleLabel":"导演","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:205585","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"やけざけ","creatorId":"vndb:s24012","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s24012","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s24012","name":"やけざけ","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:205586","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_vndb_c136820","characterName":"項羽","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c136820"},"originalCharacterName":"項羽","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"「The one to reach the Flower of Heaven shall be I, Kouu!」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The Wicked King of So, who has no mercy for her enemies."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She cuts down the enemy on the front lines of the battlefield, with her fervor engulfing her entire own army while leaving the enemy army in awe."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"As she has no one that can stand next to her as an equal, she tends to assess things based on whether something is \"Kouu, or something else\". Despite this, she is fond of Ryuuhou, the only one who is trying to rise as Kouu's equal."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although she had at first only seen Shibasen as nothing but Ryuuhou's underling, she sensed his strong sense of duty and admired his tenacity in speaking up to her despite his fear."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c136820"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/59/59c8d570e8adafd23abc3d760031288de2aa2bdcb21500b66c9fe0f3a805738b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/39/397c2b752e29a91cf65f6213dabfb98655446a48905b8bd6737e5025ccaee2f6.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"神代 岬","creatorId":"vndb:s81","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s81","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s81","name":"浅川 悠","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:97596","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c136821","characterName":"虞姫","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c136821"},"originalCharacterName":"虞姫","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Have you awoken, Airi-sama? Would you like a light meal? Or your armour? Or shall・it・be・me?\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The Hegemon King's favourite concubine. She is also a coordinator who acts as a liaison between the Hegemon King and those around him as well as a source of healing for his army."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"However, she is an assassin behind the scenes that purges threatening members of Kouu's army."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Due to her profession, she excels at gathering information more than anyone else, and has been establishing a secret cooperative relationship with Shibasen to achieve their mutual objectives."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"They have a partner-like connection in which they confide everything from comfort to complaints."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c136821"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fb/fb7d74271f87960d511c64bf2191594d382b3db91dbfa7aee7e8f604f00dafa3.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/84/849d79653504c96cedde4bde9d19279202b72fde40646d9f1fa6a9aeb70ca611.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"明羽 杏子","creatorId":"vndb:s14378","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s14378","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s14378","name":"長谷川 育美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:97603","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c136822","characterName":"范増","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c136822"},"originalCharacterName":"范増","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Telling me to do something as unreasonable as speaking in a loud voice... those extroverted people should just die already\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Tactician of Kouu's army. Despite being unsociable with a dark personality, she is sharp tongued and confident. Has a creepy smile."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"While being a tactician that many don't want to show much respect to, no one can deny her intellect, which is capable of coming up with anything from cunning tactics to ruthless schemes. Even Kouu herself displays a certain amount of respect by referring to her as Afu (akin to a younger sister) and treating her as a family member."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"As she seldom receives recognition from others, she has sworn her utmost loyal to Kouu."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She first thought of Shibasen as nothing but a vain idol in Ryuuhou's army, but after a particular incident, she began to display a great amount of gratitude towards him and became somewhat hostile to the equally devoted Chouryou."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c136822"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/93/933dce7dae806da9a32bb9da4be01e3e4432edf69c3db6bd01986279ebbd6b97.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fc/fc87864a97f172122c66603a46bc6a9630c97d9d43b0ee78798bd026aa1043a8.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"相模 恋","creatorId":"vndb:s5006","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5006","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5006","name":"湯宮 由海","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:97599","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c136823","characterName":"英布","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c136823"},"originalCharacterName":"英布","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"「I am the woman who will one day become King. I will do anything normal humans can do.」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kouu's army's top musclehead."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has a sisterly side, and her subordinates like her, but she has an unhealthy drinking problem."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Like Ryuuhou and Kouu, she aspired to be King, but her dream was destroyed when he saw the Wicked King, Kouu."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"This creates a problematic alcoholic who, when she drinks excessively, constantly complains that she has learned her limit."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has evident strengths and weaknesses. A difficult big sister who cannot be left alone but is a pain in the ass to deal with."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c136823"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/02/0213fdad2fac146f4bc03e628a7c9698281ad93a9c1f13c55ab2053750c187f5.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d4/d4ab79874458656997391ded558c543818746eff35c6b68e9c586ecc807123d4.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"葵 時緒","creatorId":"vndb:s1658","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1658","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1658","name":"葵時緒","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:97598","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c136825","characterName":"劉邦","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c136825"},"originalCharacterName":"劉邦","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"「I am the Red Dragon Maiden! And I will become 『King』of this continent！」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Self-proclaimed Red Dragon Maiden."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is an energetic girl who wants to be the \"King of the Continent\" for the mundane reasons of eating good things, wearing good clothes, being extravagant... and being freer than anyone else."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"While leaving her job as a constrictive government official to become a bandit chieftain, she encounters Shibasen, who falls from the sky and chooses to stand up for the sake of the world, the people, and herself."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"With only the determination of \"becoming king\", she comes into contact with the dreaded Kouu as an equal, even becoming sworn sisters with her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although her military prowess and planning ability are average, her courage and character, which swallow everything whole, draw many generals to her. She even accepts Shibasen, who conceals his actual name, as a friend."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c136825"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/07/07867a649f8e3e427558cf8cdf34398e1543ed7fbe983b6a959c97a2a71ff9ae.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/22/2281807a5a0354b9f4456cfa55473d45c99e00820d95c2521def5597051aaea3.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"猫村 ゆき","creatorId":"vndb:s10510","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s10510","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s10510","name":"戸板 優衣","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:97601","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c136826","characterName":"樊會","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c136826"},"originalCharacterName":"樊會","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"「I, too, have to become stronger to protect Nee-san.」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is the shock troop commander of Ryuuhou's army. A big sister who enjoys pampering."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She's Ryuuhou's childhood friend and younger sister. She likes everyone in Ryuuhou's army, who can smile even after many defeats, and Ryuuhou, who can make everyone smile happily."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Individually, she is as strong as Kouu, and she continues to support the weak Ryuuhou's army by herself."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is at first apprehensive of Shibasen as a suspicious person approaching Ryuuhou, but after trusting him with her true name, she gradually begins to coddle him and treat him overly protectively."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c136826"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/28/2864efa8c8a129161ce743d3700bf479574b5446eae4125b25af4caceac9048b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5b/5b5b31486498345621e6191ca80e5e63c0dcdf18000eb391b2ada69ae4b1e4b5.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"鈴谷 まや","creatorId":"vndb:s987","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s987","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s987","name":"榎木 実佳","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:97597","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c136827","characterName":"張良","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c136827"},"originalCharacterName":"張良","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"「As long as Ryuuhou-sama strives to defeat the Shin (Qin), I will use my talents to pave the way」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A brilliant girl who becomes a military strategist in Ryuuhou's army."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She sought to assassinate the First Emperor to avenge her country's collapse but failed. Shibasen saved her when he was hiding, and she later served Ryuuhou."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is loyal to Ryuuhou as a king, but she is also dedicated to Shibasen, to the point where she is eager to devote herself to him once her revenge is complete."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a puppy-like military strategist who adores Shibasen as her Ani-sama (elder brother)."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c136827"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/46/46eb55fa46f001c7a463f1aae4b8fff81978913e256138529eef5ce4c34af161.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/63/6375f60b72a9a4e906a6db7b08d5c66b8b9b633784fbf17ef0de54f3610ebdc3.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"風花 ましろ","creatorId":"vndb:s5762","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5762","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5762","name":"中野 純花","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:97600","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c136828","characterName":"韓信","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c136828"},"originalCharacterName":"韓信","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"「Please notice me a little bit more… honestly… But it’s true that I’m strong though…」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The strongest general in Ryuuhou's army. She is a military genius known as \"Kokushi Musou.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Despite being a modest private, she is isolated from the rest of Ryuuhou's army due to her constant boastings."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ryuuhou's army scouted her after a major push by Shibasen and was unexpectedly appointed commander-in-chief."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Because she had never been praised for her abilities, even the slightest acknowledgment would make her soar to the skies."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A rollercoaster of feeling and approval."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c136828"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b3/b3fd878ecda275b7ab13a93f49a55706a974703c3ec1a89421d5b53f5478669d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/13/13284f6e89a9683cb2da7afbc6a323411ee55a1d855a3bc98bf1ab3216d93068.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"青山 ゆかり","creatorId":"vndb:s83","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s83","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s83","name":"友永 朱音","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:97595","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c136829","characterName":"彭越","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c136829"},"originalCharacterName":"彭越","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"「One who is everywhere and rules everything under the heavens. That’s what it means to be『King』, right? 」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a freeloader under Kouu's care, with a large gang of thieves capable of rivaling an army. A worldly woman."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her academic language and calm demeanor may deceive, but she conceals her aggressive nature as the leader of a ring of thieves."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Following the conflict between Kouu and Ryuuhou, she went neutral, assisting Ryuuhou, who was clearly vanquished, in maintaining the balance between the two armies and strengthening the might of her own army behind the scenes."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c136829"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9f/9fad4f6c8fd6f190ec1969db14368f3d2f26a733c76b29c344e72b6e4e2f6e57.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/14/14f0cc124a6b47dc7cc559905371df5f767b34e6ca9d6479dd1ac39f2a602056.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"一色 ヒカル","creatorId":"vndb:s6","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s6","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s6","name":"田中 涼子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:97594","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c136830","characterName":"司馬遷","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c136830"},"originalCharacterName":"司馬遷","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"「I will move forward… to the future where everyone can smile happily」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"An alternate history administrator apprentice studying under his master, Taiitsu Shinjin, in the Celestial Realm."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"One day, he has a vision of a \"doomed future\" and descends to the lower world to preserve the alternate history in lieu of his ailing master."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"After concealing his true identity, the Ryuuhou Army welcomed him in as a \"Guide of Heaven\" to guide the Red Dragon."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"At first, he interacts with the heroines to fulfill his duties as an administrator, but as he interacts with them, he chooses to correct this history in order to \"save the people he cares about from destruction.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is sensitive, yet once he makes a decision, he acts quickly. He is also a dedicated worker who often takes on extra responsibilities."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c136830"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f9/f9a86932ce0fd1b770fcb234362081e7926add5d63f719c0d9a0038525ae1610.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/76/765087fdc5389f7da264c0b415d34962fe473ffaff75540e4b22e7bda246571c.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c136831","characterName":"難民の少女","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c136831"},"originalCharacterName":"難民の少女","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"「Onii-chan, you look like a guide from heaven. It’s as if you are not from this world.」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A young girl rescued in Kanyou by Shibasen during the destruction of the Shin Dynasty."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her girlish vivaciousness and mischievousness are evident, yet she also displays a feeling of pessimism."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c136831"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/eb/ebc6055ed9bfadb605e5a07cb6ac2a515db58c18139141b02f1373c28b6a0d3f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d7/d7ec0cb96400fe679a79ad4191f7a4292ccbd11d1f4f5bf96ea3fcae0bf5c493.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小波 すず","creatorId":"vndb:s14338","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s14338","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s14338","name":"藤沢 れい香","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:97602","source":"vndb"}]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p226","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:665","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p226","name":"BaseSon","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:36257:665","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p226","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p226","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p226","name":"ベースソン","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:131952:v50113","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p226","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p226","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p226","name":"ベースソン","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:132320:v50113","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p226","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p226","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p226","name":"ベースソン","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:132321:v50113","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p226","sourceCompanyId":